UNO — Fully working
Tic-Tac-Toe — Fully working
Connect Four — Fully working
Rock Paper Scissors — Fully working
Chess — Fully working with all 32 chess pieces rendered correctly
Trivia — Fully working
Would You Rather — Fully working

Prioritize:

1. Functional correctness
2. Chess piece completeness
3. Multiplayer synchronization
4. Server authority
5. Hidden-state privacy
6. Recovery
7. Reduced polling
8. UI feedback

Do not perform an unnecessary visual redesign. Preserve the existing CourseMates style and only modify the UI where required for gameplay clarity and reliability.